// JMAP (RFC 8620) and JMAP for Mail (RFC 8621): the session document, the
// request and response envelopes, and the method arguments this library
// builds and reads. Documents in, documents out: the caller owns the socket,
// the cookie jar and the retry policy, which is what lets the same code run
// behind fetch() in a browser.
// https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8620
// https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8621
